# Zorin XP — what stays out of git

# Copies of the XP Windows folder (only used to extract the resources into
# assets/: theme images, icons, cursors, sounds, fonts and texts). They are
# big and they are Microsoft binaries: they stay on disk only.
#   windows/xp-pro-pt  — Windows XP Professional, Portuguese (the Luna theme)
#   windows/xp-mce-en  — Windows XP Media Center Edition, English (Royale, Zune)
/windows/

# The built theme (install.sh / tools/build.py): it is generated again
/build/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# References: captures of a real XP, crops and comparison sheets (to
# measure and compare; the build does not use them). They stay on disk only.
/Screenshots/
/reference/
/icones-candidatos.png

# Context handed from one Claude Code session to the next (local only)
/SESSION-HANDOFF.md
